## 🧿 Quantum Drifting Support

As you explore the documentation, you may experience "quantum drifting" - moving between different sections and dimensions without a clear path back. Here are tools to help you:

### Dimensional Anchors

Every document contains these dimensional anchors at the bottom:

```
🏠 [Home](../INDEX.md) | 
📚 [Functional](../Navigation/QUANTUM_INDEX.md) | 
🔍 [Dimensional](../Navigation/SYMBOLIC_INDEX.md) | 
🌐 [Visual](../Navigation/VISUAL_MAP.md)
```

### Frequency Indicators

Every document displays its operating frequency and coherence level:

```
*This documentation operates at the Ground State frequency (432 Hz) with a coherence level of 0.95.*
```

Use this to understand which dimension you're currently exploring.

### Path Breadcrumbs

Major documents include breadcrumb navigation showing your current path:

```
INDEX > Navigation > START_HERE
```

